Decisions Made
--------------
- Dream duration is independent of Overworld dayTime.
- Dream sessions are tracked per player rather than globally.
- Server-side logic owns Dream lifecycle and teleportation.
- /dream commands should remain as development/debug tools.
- Dream activation should eventually be optional rather than replacing
  normal Minecraft sleeping unconditionally.
- "Dream Anchor" is the generic working name for the eventual opt-in
  mechanism so the actual block/item design can change later.

